008)\n- **Day of the Dead** (2008)\n- **Ball Don’t Lie** (2008)\n- **The Killing Room** (2009)\n- **Chi-Raq** (2015)\n- **King of the Dancehall** (2016)\n\nHe’s probably best known as an actor for **Drumline**, **Love Don’t Cost a Thing**, and **Roll Bounce**. ([en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nick_Cannon?utm_source=openai))", "transcript": "What movies does Nick Cannon play in?\n", "asr_s": 0.55, "expert_s": 5.56, "expert_input_samples": 47536, "expert_input_s": 2.971, "expert_input_sha256": "8b8702c3f2aed1699507a70d7fcca6652bbc67ab5d47a2af287412eb5eee6f4c", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 1.941, "relay_synth_ms": 26242, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 4, "feed_lag_max_ms": 302, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 302, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0054_balanced_relay.wav", "sha256": "d606e7916c0ab823e22468dc36258bcac720af49007a3ed8c2c36623dccca88f", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 58.64}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0054_balanced_candidate.wav", "sha256": "b5ff903a05df75dabab41b3dc987ce3058a32e0c8d596ad237fad022cecad7e6", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0054_balanced_stall.wav", "sha256": "2703d178c82bf0deee05dd3c366a3d636b73114b72c4ebfa5c5be2e3eadf5937", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 5.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.056, 1.102, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.054, 2.096, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.971, 3.029, 3.074, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.971, 4.03, 4.485, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.971, 5.327, 5.907, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.971, 6.026, 6.726, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.971, 7.029, 7.837, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.971, 8.031, 8.66, 0, 30720, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.971, "last_real_feed_done": 3.029, "onset": 4.485, "gate_read_done": 4.485, "fire": 4.485, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.485, "stall_note": 4.486, "stall_first_pcm": 5.273, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 8.66, "expert_req": 4.4